   "d": "2021-11-05",
   "doc": "Q3 R",
   "fy": "FY21",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "At current fuel prices and exchange rates, IAG expects its 2021 operating loss before exceptional items to be approximately €3.0 billion.",
   "file": "20211105_IAG_IAG---3rd-Quarter-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-25",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "IAG expects its operating result to be profitable from quarter two, leading both operating profit and net cash flows from operating activities to be significantly positive for the year.",
   "file": "20220225_IAG_IAG-FY-2021-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-05-06",
   "doc": "Q1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "IAG expects its operating result to be profitable from quarter two, leading both operating profit and net cash flows from operating activities to be positive for the year.",
   "file": "20220506_IAG_1st-Quarter-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-29",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "IAG expects pre-exceptional operating profit to be significantly improved for quarter 3 2022 compared to quarter 2 and to be positive for full year 2022.",
   "file": "20220729_IAG_IAG-Interim-Management-Report-to-June-30-2022.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-10-13",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 2,
   "q": "Trading during the third quarter has been better than expected due to passenger revenue strength. As a result, we now expect pre-exceptional operating profit for the third quarter to be in the region of €1.2 billion.",
   "file": "20221013_IAG_IAG-preliminary-third-quarter-operating-result.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-10-28",
   "doc": "Q3 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "At current fuel prices and exchange rates, IAG expects its 2022 pre-exceptional operating profit to be approximately €1.1 billion.",
   "file": "20221028_IAG_IAG-3rd-Quarter-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-24",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Full year 2023 operating profit before exceptional items expected to be in the range of €1.8 to €2.3 billion, with most of the improvement over 2022 in the first half of the year.",
   "file": "20230224_IAG_IAG-FY-2022-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-05-05",
   "doc": "Q1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 2,
   "q": "Taking the above into account, together with the quarter 1 performance, we currently expect our full year 2023 operating profit before exceptional items to be higher than the top end of our previous guidance of €1.8 billion to €2.3 billion.",
   "file": "20230505_IAG_IAG-1st-Quarter-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We expect to generate sustainable free cash flow this year and for our net debt at December 31, 2023 to reduce compared to December 31, 2022, in line with our profit outperformance",
   "file": "20230728_IAG_IAG-Interim-Management-Report-to-June-30-2023.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-10-27",
   "doc": "Q3 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "We expect 2023 to be a year of strong recovery in our margins, operating profit and balance sheet and towards pre-COVID-19 levels of capacity.",
   "file": "20231027_IAG_IAG-Announces-3rd-Quarter-Results.md",
   "gnote": "withdrawn"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-02-29",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Positive outlook for 2024: confidence in significant free cash flow generation; disciplined capital allocation will maintain our strong balance sheet; committed to sustainable shareholder value creation and cash returns",
   "file": "20240229_IAG_IAG-FY-2023-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-05-10",
   "doc": "Q1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
